message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below, and cite the datasets listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md."
title: "SafeSight AI: industrial worker-safety monitoring through computer vision"
abstract: >-
  A research prototype for hard-hat (PPE) compliance monitoring, worker tracking, restricted-zone intrusion detection
  and incident management from video, using a fine-tuned YOLO26n detector, ByteTrack and multi-frame state confirmation.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SafeSight AI contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/nj-codes-24/SafeSight-AI"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
keywords:
  - computer vision
  - PPE detection
  - worker safety
  - object detection
  - multi-object tracking
